      "body": "Bumps the dependencies group with 3 updates: [github/gh-aw-actions/setup](https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions), [github/gh-aw-actions/setup-cli](https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions) and [actions/ai-inference](https://github.com/actions/ai-inference).\n\nUpdates `github/gh-aw-actions/setup` from 0.85.0 to 0.86.2\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/releases\">github/gh-aw-actions/setup's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v0.86.2</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.86.2</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.86.1</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.86.1</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.86.0</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.86.0</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.85.4</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.85.4</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.85.1</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.85.1</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/commit/6aab9e5b5c91c615506061f09bedd81a23babe3c\"><code>6aab9e5</code></a> chore: sync actions from gh-aw@v0.86.2 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/issues/212\">#212</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/commit/8914f47b6c1bb8a802c7549f5ac1a81434b66403\"><code>8914f47</code></a> chore: sync actions from gh-aw@v0.86.1 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/issues/211\">#211</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/commit/19356acbcf6b0677aa06bacc1b9894fe883ae751\"><code>19356ac</code></a> chore: sync actions from gh-aw@v0.86.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/issues/210\">#210</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/commit/2709137ea6c5b0e19aa621454dc643ea8dc526b1\"><code>2709137</code></a> chore: sync actions from gh-aw@v0.85.4 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/issues/209\">#209</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/commit/b078ca291c0c4d3f7bfb88b0f9a01dfb718671e3\"><code>b078ca2</code></a> chore: sync actions from gh-aw@v0.85.1 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/issues/208\">#208</a>)</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/compare/32d9b58ee2cb05ad425047708d978e258d7b09ac...6aab9e5b5c91c615506061f09bedd81a23babe3c\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `github/gh-aw-actions/setup-cli` from 0.85.0 to 0.86.2\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/releases\">github/gh-aw-actions/setup-cli's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v0.86.2</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.86.2</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.86.1</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.86.1</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.86.0</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.86.0</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.85.4</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.85.4</code>.</p>\n<h2>v0.85.1</h2>\n<p>Sync of actions from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw\">gh-aw</a> at <code>v0.85.1</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/commit/6aab9e5b5c91c615506061f09bedd81a23babe3c\"><code>6aab9e5</code></a> chore: sync actions from gh-aw@v0.86.2 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/issues/212\">#212</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/commit/8914f47b6c1bb8a802c7549f5ac1a81434b66403\"><code>8914f47</code></a> chore: sync actions from gh-aw@v0.86.1 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/issues/211\">#211</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/commit/19356acbcf6b0677aa06bacc1b9894fe883ae751\"><code>19356ac</code></a> chore: sync actions from gh-aw@v0.86.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/issues/210\">#210</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/commit/2709137ea6c5b0e19aa621454dc643ea8dc526b1\"><code>2709137</code></a> chore: sync actions from gh-aw@v0.85.4 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/issues/209\">#209</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/commit/b078ca291c0c4d3f7bfb88b0f9a01dfb718671e3\"><code>b078ca2</code></a> chore: sync actions from gh-aw@v0.85.1 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/issues/208\">#208</a>)</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a href=\"https://github.com/github/gh-aw-actions/compare/32d9b58ee2cb05ad425047708d978e258d7b09ac...6aab9e5b5c91c615506061f09bedd81a23babe3c\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `actions/ai-inference` from 2.1.0 to 3\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/actions/ai-inference/releases\">actions/ai-inference's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v3</h2>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Feat: remove github-models support and make copilot the only provider by <a href=\"https://github.com/jalafel\"><code>@​jalafel</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/ai-inference/pull/236\">actions/ai-inference#236</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>chore(deps): bump js-yaml from 4.1.1 to 4.3.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/ai-inference/pull/242\">actions/ai-inference#242</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>chore(deps): bump hono from 4.12.22 to 4.12.26 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/ai-inference/pull/241\">actions/ai-inference#241</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>chore(deps-dev): bump vite from 7.3.3 to 7.3.6 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/ai-inference/pull/245\">actions/ai-inference#245</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>chore(deps): bump the actions-minor group across 1 directory with 2 updates by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/ai-inference/pull/246\">actions/ai-inference#246</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>chore(deps): bump actions/setup-node from 4 to 6 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/ai-inference/pull/194\">actions/ai-inference#194</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>chore(deps): bump actions/upload-artifact from 5 to 7 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/ai-inference/pull/195\">actions/ai-inference#195</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>chore(deps-dev): bump <code>@​rollup/plugin-commonjs</code> from 28.0.5 to 29.0.3 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/ai-inference/pull/197\">actions/ai-inference#197</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>chore(deps): bump tmp from 0.2.5 to 0.2.7 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/ai-inference/pull/232\">actions/ai-inference#232</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>chore(deps-dev): bump the npm-development group across 1 directory with 7 updates by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/ai-inference/pull/237\">actions/ai-inference#237</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/jalafel\"><code>@​jalafel</code></a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/ai-inference/pull/236\">actions/ai-inference#236</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/actions/ai-inference/compare/v2...v3\">https://github.com/actions/ai-inference/compare/v2...v3</a></p>\n<h2>v2.1.1</h2>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>fix: delay process.exit on Windows to dodge libuv UV_HANDLE_CLOSING crash by <a href=\"https://github.com/mickey-mikey\"><code>@​mickey-mikey</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/ai-inference/pull/228\">actions/ai-inference#228</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mickey-mikey\"><code>@​mickey-mikey</code></a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/ai-inference/pull/228\">actions/ai-inference#228</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/actions/ai-inference/compare/v2...v2.1.1\">https://github.com/actions/ai-inference/compare/v2...v2.1.1</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/ai-inference/commit/2c43c91ae16266ca159d311430343c67a5ffa222\"><code>2c43c91</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/ai-inference/issues/236\">#236</a> from jalafel/jalafel/delete-github-models</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/ai-inference/commit/0ac1e35b6f7e297dffc5a6b17512d3510d0b1b96\"><code>0ac1e35</code></a> refine test response</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/ai-inference/commit/aacc9f22932323936593790a25978a1da3a0dd4a\"><code>aacc9f2</code></a> Fix local actions test with mock Copilot CLI</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/ai-